Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: beautiful terminal UI client for gRPC
 Chiko is a terminal user interface (TUI) client for exploring and calling
 gRPC services, built on top of grpcurl and tview. It removes the need to
 memorise long grpcurl command lines by offering an interactive interface.
 .
 Features include:
  * server reflection based discovery of services and methods;
  * an editable JSON request payload and custom request metadata;
  * bookmarks with categories and a history of previous invocations;
  * TLS, mutual TLS and plain-text connections;
  * authorization headers and a built-in file picker for certificates.
